# Compact liquid-water grid for the V24/V25 cloud-temperature comparison
# (validation/v25/temperature_profiles/compact_lut.py).  Not a production grid:
# every value is a node of the approved Grid B liquid-water-cloud.lut; all 24
# optical depths are kept so that the behaviour along tau can be checked.
24 uneven_logarithmic # optical depth
1e-10 0.0078125 0.015625 0.03125 0.0625 0.125 0.25 0.5 1.0 2.0 2.82842712474619 4.0 5.65685424949238 8.0 11.3137084989848 16.0 22.6274169979695 32.0 45.254833995939 64.0 90.509667991878 128.0 181.019335983756 256.0
3 uneven_linear # physical effective radius, microns
3.0 11.0 35.0
3 uneven_linear # solar zenith, degrees
0.0 30.0 60.0
4 uneven_linear # satellite zenith, degrees
0.0 30.0 60.0 75.0
3 linear # relative azimuth, degrees, 0-180
0 180
